Z||000012||artherd||12-10-2001||09:57 PM||||Better buy a neck-brace, because the Northstar will rip your head clean off!<P>It's enough to push the 4500+lb caddys to over 150mph. ... (the few that are not artifically limited, ETC Eldorado.)<P>Drop over 300hp into your fiero, and loose 25lbs at the same time?  low 13sec ETs with the HEAVY inefficent auto tranny...<P>Your dad's old, isn't he?  4-valve! DOHC! The Northstar is a BIG(ish) engine, that also *Breathes!*    With another $2k into just the heads, the rest of the engine is good for over 450bhp at 8,000rpm. giddy up!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/northstar/2/nstar-front-on.jpg"> <P>If you still don't want one, better check for a pulse  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LoW_KeY:<BR><B>Ok another question   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>isn't the overall performance almost like a 350? told my dad the size and he's like why does everyone want a northstar?<P>He was thinking the car wouldn't go that good with one..<P>-KC</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
